# ============================================================
# Whitelist-style .gitignore
# Default: EVERYTHING is ignored. Only files/directories
# explicitly un-ignored below are tracked.
# To add a new tracked path, append a negation rule here.
# ============================================================

# Ignore everything at all levels
*

# But let git descend into directories
!*/

# --- Repository base files ---
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!README.md

# --- Project directories ---
!/hooks/**
!/docs/**
!/CONTEXT.md
!/config.example.toml
!/docs/adr/**
